SESSION_PASSWORD
# The password used to encrypt the ironsession cookie.
# It has to be at least 32 characters long. Use https://1password.com/password-generator/ to generate strong passwords.

PANEL_USER
# This is a temporary field that stores the username of the accounts allowed to log in. You can have multiple users by splitting names with commas.
# TODO: Store this in the database

PANEL_PASSWORD
# See PANEL_USER. Expects same number of passwords as usernames.

NEXT_PUBLIC_MCCWSS_PORT
# The port that the minecraft console webserver socket should be opened on.
# This is annotated as NEXT_PUBLIC_ to allow it to be sent to the client.
